Syntax: evaluate <item>

Resourcefulness lets a looter glean where a piece of equipment may be found.
When evaluating an item, this skill can reveal enemies known to wear, wield or
carry that object, along with the areas where those foes may be encountered.

This information reflects potential sources only.  It does not guarantee that
the item is present at that moment, nor does it promise that every possible
source will currently have the item.

To use this skill, you must first be able to evaluate the item in question.
Resourcefulness is an enhancement to the evaluate skill, not a standalone ability.

See Also: EVALUATE
